1
00:00:12,480 --> 00:00:13,840
Even if it's just for one day,

2
00:00:14,320 --> 00:00:15,280
I will stay with her.

3
00:00:15,920 --> 00:00:17,000
If you stay here,

4
00:00:18,520 --> 00:00:20,160
you'll have less than a month left.

5
00:00:30,080 --> 00:00:30,680
Sis,

6
00:00:32,040 --> 00:00:32,800
do me a favor.

7
00:00:32,920 --> 00:00:33,880
How do you want me to help you?

8
00:00:33,960 --> 00:00:34,880
Be part of an act with me.

9
00:00:34,920 --> 00:00:35,920
Hao Ruichi,

10
00:00:44,960 --> 00:00:46,240
as long as there's still time,

11
00:00:48,880 --> 00:00:50,680
I will spend every moment with her.

12
00:00:52,840 --> 00:00:55,320
I want to help her do every little thing that brings happiness,

13
00:00:56,280 --> 00:00:57,120
one by one.

14
00:00:57,680 --> 00:01:00,160
To create an illusion where she's surrounded by happiness,

15
00:01:00,880 --> 00:01:02,120
are you willing to trade your life?

16
00:01:02,720 --> 00:01:03,600
Is it worth it?

17
00:01:05,040 --> 00:01:06,520
Qi Miao lost her parents when she was very young.

18
00:01:06,600 --> 00:01:07,480
They left her behind.

19
00:01:10,320 --> 00:01:11,480
Since childhood,

20
00:01:12,560 --> 00:01:14,080
she has only ever had one close friend.

21
00:01:15,880 --> 00:01:17,120
At work,

22
00:01:17,640 --> 00:01:18,760
she's always bullied.

23
00:01:20,960 --> 00:01:21,920
In life,

24
00:01:23,840 --> 00:01:25,520
she constantly encounters unlucky things.

25
00:01:32,920 --> 00:01:35,040
She always looks strong on the surface,

26
00:01:35,320 --> 00:01:36,160
but I know deep down,

27
00:01:38,080 --> 00:01:40,000
what she fears most is abandonment.

28
00:01:42,560 --> 00:01:43,320
That's why,

29
00:01:46,640 --> 00:01:49,320
in this last month,

30
00:01:51,040 --> 00:01:52,080
I want to spend it with her properly.

31
00:02:08,560 --> 00:02:09,760
It's been a long time since we went out.

32
00:02:14,360 --> 00:02:15,000
What are you writing?

33
00:02:15,760 --> 00:02:17,880
A list of 100 little things couples do together.

34
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:18,720
Today,

35
00:02:18,760 --> 00:02:20,680
is our first real date.

36
00:02:24,080 --> 00:02:24,840
In the future,

37
00:02:25,160 --> 00:02:27,280
there are thousands, even tens of thousands, of things

38
00:02:27,680 --> 00:02:28,880
waiting for us to experience together.

39
00:02:31,880 --> 00:02:32,680
But,

40
00:02:32,800 --> 00:02:34,440
are you really feeling okay?

41
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:36,400
Shouldn't you rest for a few more days?

42
00:02:37,680 --> 00:02:38,640
You don't trust me?

43
00:02:40,920 --> 00:02:41,280
You—

44
00:02:41,600 --> 00:02:42,400
What are you doing?

45
00:02:42,920 --> 00:02:44,640
Alright, I get it, you're fine now.

46
00:02:44,720 --> 00:02:45,880
Put me down.

47
00:02:45,920 --> 00:02:46,720
No way.

48
00:02:46,800 --> 00:02:47,920
I want to prove something.

49
00:03:05,760 --> 00:03:08,400
In TV dramas, it's always the guy giving the girl a ride.

50
00:03:09,120 --> 00:03:10,320
Why do you insist on giving me a ride?

51
00:03:10,720 --> 00:03:12,040
That's just in TV dramas!

52
00:03:12,480 --> 00:03:14,600
My boyfriend is a Star Messenger.

53
00:03:14,720 --> 00:03:16,000
Of course, we have to be different from others.

54
00:03:19,480 --> 00:03:20,360
Aren't you tired?

55
00:03:20,440 --> 00:03:20,920
Not at all.

56
00:03:21,360 --> 00:03:22,520
This is nothing.

57
00:03:22,840 --> 00:03:23,560
Hold on tight.

58
00:03:23,640 --> 00:03:24,440
I'm speeding up now.

59
00:03:25,440 --> 00:03:25,960
Alright.

60
00:04:11,720 --> 00:04:12,120
Here.

61
00:04:14,000 --> 00:04:15,320
Eat slower this time.

62
00:04:15,400 --> 00:04:16,320
Don't get yourself chilled again.

63
00:04:16,760 --> 00:04:17,920
Am I as silly as you?

64
00:04:23,680 --> 00:04:24,439
Hao Ruichi.

65
00:04:25,720 --> 00:04:27,080
Thank you for coming to my side.

66
00:04:27,760 --> 00:04:29,480
Thank you for becoming my lucky star.

67
00:04:31,400 --> 00:04:32,440
Why are you saying this all of a sudden?

68
00:04:33,240 --> 00:04:35,960
Because I feel so happy right now.

69
00:04:55,920 --> 00:04:56,800
What's wrong?

70
00:04:57,920 --> 00:04:58,640
It's nothing.

71
00:05:02,320 --> 00:05:03,160
Oh, by the way...

72
00:05:03,280 --> 00:05:05,160
That snail noodle we had last time was really good.

73
00:05:05,200 --> 00:05:06,080
I want to eat it again.

74
00:05:06,160 --> 00:05:07,080
Let’s go and have some.

75
00:05:08,520 --> 00:05:09,040
Alright.

76
00:05:10,360 --> 00:05:11,400
Wait for me a bit.

77
00:05:12,120 --> 00:05:13,280
I'm heading to the restroom.

78
00:05:13,480 --> 00:05:14,080
Okay.

79
00:05:33,840 --> 00:05:35,200
Even if it's just a small amount of time,

80
00:05:36,440 --> 00:05:38,040
I want to spend every moment with her,

81
00:05:39,600 --> 00:05:41,800
doing everything that brings her happiness.

82
00:05:41,840 --> 00:05:42,680
Every single thing.

83
00:05:43,720 --> 00:05:46,080
To create an illusion of being surrounded by happiness for her,

84
00:05:46,320 --> 00:05:47,600
would you trade your life?

85
00:05:48,120 --> 00:05:48,880
Is it worth it?

86
00:06:46,640 --> 00:06:47,400
Hao Ruichi,

87
00:06:48,800 --> 00:06:49,560
you must be tired.

88
00:06:49,800 --> 00:06:51,680
Why don’t we head home after dinner?

89
00:06:52,840 --> 00:06:53,400
No way.

90
00:06:54,360 --> 00:06:55,920
There are still so many things we haven’t done yet.

91
00:06:57,040 --> 00:06:58,640
I've already felt so happy today.

92
00:06:59,000 --> 00:07:00,280
Let's complete the items on our list,

93
00:07:00,440 --> 00:07:01,520
one step at a time.

94
00:07:05,080 --> 00:07:05,920
Excuse me,

95
00:07:07,840 --> 00:07:08,560
sorry to bother you.

96
00:07:09,440 --> 00:07:12,040
You two happen to be our 1,000th customers.

97
00:07:12,720 --> 00:07:13,760
This meal is on the house!

98
00:07:14,200 --> 00:07:14,920
However,

99
00:07:15,080 --> 00:07:16,840
can we take a picture of you two to commemorate this?

100
00:07:19,400 --> 00:07:20,120
Of course!

101
00:07:20,960 --> 00:07:21,560
Boss,

102
00:07:22,560 --> 00:07:24,680
there are so many people who come to eat here.

103
00:07:24,800 --> 00:07:25,840
Do you really remember every one of them?

104
00:07:25,920 --> 00:07:26,880
Of course I do.

105
00:07:27,240 --> 00:07:28,480
Anyone who has been to our restaurant,

106
00:07:28,560 --> 00:07:29,520
I remember them.

107
00:07:30,640 --> 00:07:32,960
Every encounter is worth cherishing.

108
00:07:33,560 --> 00:07:36,120
I just want to preserve more beautiful moments.

109
00:07:36,920 --> 00:07:38,240
Let me take a photo of you two.

110
00:07:40,440 --> 00:07:40,840
Come on.

111
00:07:41,240 --> 00:07:42,280
Get a little closer, you two.

112
00:07:46,040 --> 00:07:46,840
Ready? Here we go.

113
00:07:47,160 --> 00:07:49,240
3, 2, 1... Cheese!

114
00:07:52,960 --> 00:07:53,320
Perfect!

115
00:07:53,360 --> 00:07:54,080
Let's do another pose,

116
00:07:54,200 --> 00:07:54,800
one more photo.

117
00:07:57,320 --> 00:07:59,760
3, 2, 1... Cheese!

118
00:08:03,200 --> 00:08:05,240
I'll give you this photo as a keepsake.

119
00:08:05,560 --> 00:08:06,600
You two make such a lovely couple.

120
00:08:07,040 --> 00:08:08,160
Wishing you everlasting happiness.

121
00:08:08,800 --> 00:08:10,240
We definitely will!

122
00:08:10,360 --> 00:08:11,120
Thank you, boss!

123
00:08:33,000 --> 00:08:33,760
You're not going home?

124
00:08:33,880 --> 00:08:35,440
You just wanted to come here to keep an eye on me?

125
00:08:39,959 --> 00:08:40,599
Let's just say,

126
00:08:41,199 --> 00:08:42,920
we're getting a head start on living like an old married couple.

127
00:08:44,719 --> 00:08:45,480
Hao Ruichi,

128
00:08:46,199 --> 00:08:47,599
have you ever thought about

129
00:08:47,719 --> 00:08:49,320
the kind of life you want in the future?

130
00:08:58,480 --> 00:09:00,080
I want to wake up every day,

131
00:09:02,040 --> 00:09:03,160
and see you by my side.

132
00:09:05,680 --> 00:09:07,520
We’ll have a slow, peaceful breakfast together.

133
00:09:09,160 --> 00:09:10,600
I'll get myself a job too.

134
00:09:13,120 --> 00:09:14,200
Then,

135
00:09:15,840 --> 00:09:17,320
I'll drive you to work in the morning,

136
00:09:19,160 --> 00:09:20,400
and pick you up in the evening.

137
00:09:21,160 --> 00:09:22,280
After dinner,

138
00:09:23,960 --> 00:09:25,920
we can go for a stroll, just like today.

139
00:09:27,320 --> 00:09:28,720
Let's talk about daily life.

140
00:09:32,840 --> 00:09:34,000
During vacations,

141
00:09:34,560 --> 00:09:36,120
we can go out and relax.

142
00:09:39,120 --> 00:09:40,480
We can attend Alan's concert,

143
00:09:47,400 --> 00:09:51,120
then catch up with Jian Dan and Ai Yi Te,

144
00:09:53,880 --> 00:09:55,240
discussing life updates.

145
00:10:02,640 --> 00:10:03,400
Of course,

146
00:10:05,640 --> 00:10:07,320
sometimes we might argue.

147
00:10:13,200 --> 00:10:15,000
I'll be the one to apologize first,

148
00:10:17,040 --> 00:10:18,400
then cheer you up.

149
00:10:28,480 --> 00:10:29,040
This,

150
00:10:31,520 --> 00:10:33,280
this is the life I want.

151
00:10:43,880 --> 00:10:44,640
Hao Ruichi,

152
00:10:45,680 --> 00:10:46,800
let's go home.

153
00:10:48,680 --> 00:10:49,520
Hao Ruichi,

154
00:10:51,880 --> 00:10:52,800
Hao Ruichi,

155
00:10:55,000 --> 00:10:56,480
let's go home.

156
00:11:06,600 --> 00:11:07,600
Do you know

157
00:11:08,280 --> 00:11:10,040
that I have my own idea of life too?

158
00:11:12,960 --> 00:11:15,120
I want my life to be just like before.

159
00:11:18,360 --> 00:11:22,240
I want Qi Dongdong causing trouble every day.

160
00:11:23,040 --> 00:11:25,760
I want my life to remain chaotic as ever.

161
00:11:26,720 --> 00:11:29,640
I want my parents to still be distant from me.

162
00:11:30,640 --> 00:11:33,440
I want my misfortunes to continue to pile up.

163
00:11:34,840 --> 00:11:35,400
Because,

164
00:11:36,520 --> 00:11:39,800
because I want to trade all my good luck,

165
00:11:40,760 --> 00:11:42,280
to trade for your good health,

166
00:11:45,560 --> 00:11:47,280
to trade for your peace of mind for a lifetime.

167
00:11:49,360 --> 00:11:51,600
I don't want to grow old so quickly.

168
00:11:52,600 --> 00:11:53,440
I want,

169
00:11:54,200 --> 00:11:57,720
I want us to be able to meet again someday.

170
00:11:59,520 --> 00:12:01,840
To be able to sit here and chat together again,

171
00:12:03,600 --> 00:12:04,960
to go for walks together,

172
00:12:06,720 --> 00:12:09,440
to do a hundred little things together.
